<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northland Cranberries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northland Cranberries.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth analyst Bonnie Wittenburg said Friday she lowered her third quarter earnings estimate for Northland Cranberries Inc to $0.18 a share from $0.19, but left her earnings estimate for fiscal 1997 unchanged at $0.70 a share.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Northland reported second quarter earnings of $0.11 a share, above Wittenburg's estimate of $0.10, compared with earnings of $0.01 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Wittenburg reiterated her buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Her price target continues to be $30 a share, based on a price to earnings multiple of 27 times the fiscal 1998 earnings per share estimate of $1.10.</p>
<p>-- Northland Cranberries shares were unchanged at $17.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
